			description: [
				"Great, you deci&kded to le&rarn. Alright, the&k fi&rrst thing you'll nee&kd is a&r &o&6Flesh Plunderer.&r It's a s&kick&rle of sorts, &o&6made fr&kom bon&r&o&6e and raw meat.&r I... wish I could tel&kl yo&ru &kmo&rre on how to mak&ke on&re."
				"It's a crucial tool needed to g&kathe&rr impo&krta&rnt items fro&km mob&rs that they otherwise w&kould no&rt usually dr&ko&rp. Just... make one, th&ken go and k&rill a bunc&kh of m&robs, especially pred&kato&rrs, the ones with sharp claws and fangs."
