		{
			dependencies: ["37A7B469D081A654"]
			description: [
				"Have you &ktr&ried feedin&kg the c&rradle yet? If not, you sh&koul&rd. Offe&kr it r&raw meat and then a &ks&racrifice with life properties, such as a he&kalt&rh &kpo&rtion or &kgo&rlden apple. It should spit out a &o&6flesh blob&r. These guys are raw, &kpr&rimal life, and they'll do n&kothing&r but consume wha&kte&rver they can find, so ma&kke s&rure you don't ha&kve an&ry pets nearby. You can also drop food on the ground for them. Whatever &kwo&rrks, &o&6as long as they eat it and grow&r."
				"Then yo&ku ne&red to kill it. I know that sounds counterproductive, but that's the best way to get &o&6Living Flesh&r. The &kla&rrger the blob &kis, t&rhe more flesh you'll &kg&ret from &kkil&rling it."
