		{
			dependencies: ["4537DD077CD404BF"]
			description: [
				"The &6&oBio-F&korg&r&o&6e&r is one of you&kr mo&rst impor&ktan&rt machines in Biomancy. It'll a&kllo&rw you to cra&kft m&rost items. On th&ke&r left of t&khe m&renu, you should &ks&ree the items that are cra&kftab&rle. Clicking on on&ke will s&rhow it's ma&kte&rrial comp&kon&rents in the sl&ko&rts on the rig&kht&r. You should also s&kee&r a bar to th&ke le&rft of the sele&kcte&rd item. That's the forge's su&kpp&rly of &o&6nutrients&r. They &kfunc&rtion as the fuel f&kor t&rhese devices. N&kothi&rng can be done w&kith&rout nutrients, and nutri&kents&r can be taken from &o&6any kind of food&r."
				"You pr&kobabl&ry don't &kh&rave all the mate&krial&rs yo&ku n&reed. That's where the &o&6Decomposer&r comes into play."
				"{image:modpack:textures/bioforge.png width:100 height:70 align:center}"
			]
			hide_until_deps_visible: true
