		{
			dependencies: ["4537DD077CD404BF"]
			description: [
				"On&ke o&rf the m&kain m&rachines you'll &ku&rse is &o&6The Decomposer&r. It w&kil&rl take in &kite&rms and bre&ka&rk them down to th&keir m&raterial com&kpone&rnts. Like al&kl oth&rer mac&khin&res, you mus&kt s&rupply the Decomposer with &o&6nutrients&r, which ca&kn&r be done by &kpl&racing food i&kn the s&rlot on the &kl&reft."
				"Af&kte&rr that, &kyo&ru just need &kto p&rut in the items yo&ku w&rish to break &kdo&rwn and wait. The&ks&re materials &kwil&rl be used heavily in rec&kipe&rs from &6&oThe Bio-Forge&r."
				"{image:modpack:textures/decomposer.png width:100 height:110 align:center}"
