		{
			dependencies: ["37A7B469D081A654"]
			description: [
				"Uh, hey, have you noticed any &o&6Malignant Flesh Veins&r appearing when you perform a sacrifice? They're hard to miss. If you do, well... you might want to get rid of them before they spread."
				"B-but they aren't necessarily a &obad&r thing. If you wait, let them spread, you'll see all sorts of new blocks. Fleshy ones. They make for a great source of raw material."
