		{
			dependencies: ["7B7F34E2C34E28FA"]
			description: [
				"So, you &kprob&rably don't want to b&ke const&rantly giving the ma&kchines meat fo&rr nutrients, right? Well, you have the Bio-Forge now, so you can make a &o&6Digester&r."
				"The Digester&k is ra&rther simple. You put any&k sort of &rorganic material like meat or plants inside, and it'll convert them into &o&6Nutrient Paste&r. This is a great sou&krce of n&rutrients, and&k when compr&ressed into &o&6Nutrient Bars&r, can&k be a&r very good option for food."
