				"Instead, you'll want to craft a &o&6Bio-Injector&r. Think of it like a &obig&r needle. &oTo open its inventory, press the main-hand action key (Default: V)&r. After that, you can select the serum you want to load into it. From there, it's as simple as right clicking a mob to inject the serum into it, or holding shift and right clicking to inject the serum into yourself."
