			dependencies: ["306086EE9B34A8CC"]
			description: ["While watching the flesh spread, did you come across any berries? Bloomberry's form near outer walls of flesh. They can be picked and then consumed for random potion effects. Alternatively, you can let a fully grown bloomberry continue growing before it's launched into the sky. After traveling a bit, they'll explode into malignant veins, continuing the spread of the flesh."]
